<title>UK: Banco del Suquia sets $75 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco del Suquia sets $75 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO DEL SUQUIA</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+295 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
</text>
